# ScholarPath — Phase 1 Rules

## Scope Guard

Phase 1 only. Do NOT implement:
- AI / Claude API / recommendations / motivation letter generation
- Email or in-app notifications
- Community (posts, comments, forum)
- Career opportunities module
- Scraping or data automation

## Stack

- Monorepo: Turborepo (`apps/web`, `apps/api`)
- Frontend: Next.js App Router, Hebrew UI
- Backend: NestJS + Prisma + PostgreSQL
- Auth: NextAuth (email + Google OAuth)

## Code Conventions

- TypeScript strict; DTOs with class-validator
- Hebrew in UI strings; English in code and comments
- PostgreSQL is source of truth — AI never writes to DB (future phases)
- NestJS modules: Auth, Student, Scholarship, Application, Admin

## Application States

`NOT_STARTED → IN_PROGRESS → SUBMITTED → ACCEPTED | REJECTED`

User-initiated transitions only.

## Before Adding Features

Check `AGENTS.md` and `DOCS/scholar_path_phases_plan_v_0.md` for current phase scope.
